      "id": "line_001",
      "speaker_id": "62b69800-fcb3-4c95-9425-1bf976b4fabb",
      "text": "Hey Maya! Are you ready to talk about planning a healthy weekday routine?",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [
          "healthy routine",
          "weekday routine"
        ],
        "idioms": [],
        "grammar_point": "Present Simple — question"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_002",
      "speaker_id": "af538508-e620-4fcf-a20a-792a284801be",
      "text": "Totally! I really need to stick to a good schedule because work has been so busy lately.",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [],
        "idioms": [],
        "grammar_point": "Present Perfect — recent state/situation"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_003",
      "speaker_id": "62b69800-fcb3-4c95-9425-1bf976b4fabb",
      "text": "I hear you. If you wake up early, it is much easier to start on the right foot.",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [],
        "idioms": [
          "start on the right foot"
        ],
        "grammar_point": "First Conditional — real condition"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_004",
      "speaker_id": "af538508-e620-4fcf-a20a-792a284801be",
      "text": "That is so true. I usually try to work out for twenty minutes before I start my workday.",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [],
        "idioms": [],
        "grammar_point": "Present Simple — routine habit"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_005",
      "speaker_id": "62b69800-fcb3-4c95-9425-1bf976b4fabb",
      "text": "Oh really? I can never work up the energy for exercise so early in the morning.",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [
          "early in the morning"
        ],
        "idioms": [],
        "grammar_point": "Modal Verbs — expressing ability"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_006",
      "speaker_id": "af538508-e620-4fcf-a20a-792a284801be",
      "text": "Well, if you go to bed earlier, you will definitely feel much more refreshed.",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [
          "go to bed"
        ],
        "idioms": [],
        "grammar_point": "First Conditional — future consequence"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_007",
      "speaker_id": "62b69800-fcb3-4c95-9425-1bf976b4fabb",
      "text": "I know, right? I should really cut down on my screen time late at night.",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [
          "screen time"
        ],
        "idioms": [],
        "grammar_point": "Modal Verbs — recommendation"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_008",
      "speaker_id": "af538508-e620-4fcf-a20a-792a284801be",
      "text": "Definitely! Also, preparing your lunch ahead of time is a piece of cake once you practice.",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [
          "ahead of time"
        ],
        "idioms": [
          "piece of cake"
        ],
        "grammar_point": "Gerund phrase as subject"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_009",
      "speaker_id": "62b69800-fcb3-4c95-9425-1bf976b4fabb",
      "text": "I agree. Having healthy snacks ready keeps me from eating junk food when I am tired.",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [
          "healthy snacks",
          "junk food"
        ],
        "idioms": [],
        "grammar_point": "Present Simple — habit and result"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_010",
      "speaker_id": "af538508-e620-4fcf-a20a-792a284801be",
      "text": "Exactly! Taking small steps like that will help us stay on track all week long.",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [
          "small steps"
        ],
        "idioms": [
          "stay on track"
        ],
        "grammar_point": "Future Simple — general prediction"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_011",
      "speaker_id": "62b69800-fcb3-4c95-9425-1bf976b4fabb",
      "text": "Yeah, that makes total sense. Let me write down these goals so I do not forget.",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [
          "make sense"
        ],
        "idioms": [],
        "grammar_point": "Imperative with 'let me'"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_012",
      "speaker_id": "af538508-e620-4fcf-a20a-792a284801be",
      "text": "Great idea! If we support each other, sticking to our healthy routine will be easy.",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [
          "healthy routine"
        ],
        "idioms": [],
        "grammar_point": "First Conditional — real future condition"
